{
  "_comment": "PURR OS icon manifest. Each entry may carry a slug per pack; convert_icons.py picks the one for its ACTIVE_PACK and falls back to any other present slug so a partial migration still builds. 'ion' = Ionicons (MIT, ionic-team/ionicons, src/svg/<slug>.svg) — unsuffixed slugs are the FILLED variants, which is what reads at icon size. 'mdi' = Material Design Icons, kept so the old pack stays one ACTIVE_PACK edit away.",
